> Inspect the fixed final samples: Clipped WGAN

The clipped trial leaves a diagonal band of generated points through the centre;
it does not match the eight separated ring components. Its tiny test critic gap1.2904093e-7 and
G loss2.707525e-5 reflect a tightly constrained critic. They do not establish that
the fitted distribution is close to the real pool. Every critic value remains
within Float32±.01, including biases. Source single/batch parity error is0.

